#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:272
msgid ""
"``Xc`` / ``Yc`` / ``Zc`` denote the chip's intrinsic axes (as printed in the"
" BNO055 datasheet). The \"Output\" columns are the axes the device delivers "
"via :meth:`BNO055.euler`, :meth:`BNO055.gyro`, etc. ``P0`` through ``P3`` "
"are the four 90° rotations of the chip in the component-side-up orientation;"
" ``P4`` through ``P7`` are the same four rotations after flipping the chip "
"onto its back."
msgstr ""
"``Xc`` / ``Yc`` / ``Zc`` duiden de intrinsieke assen van de chip aan (zoals "
"afgedrukt in het BNO055-datasheet). De \"Uitvoer\"-kolommen zijn de assen "
"die het apparaat levert via :meth:`BNO055.euler`\\ , :meth:`BNO055.gyro`\\ ,"
" enz. ``P0`` tot en met ``P3`` zijn de vier 90°-rotaties van de chip met de "
"componentzijde naar boven; ``P4`` tot en met ``P7`` zijn diezelfde vier "
"rotaties nadat de chip op zijn rug is gekanteld."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:282
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 90° CCW from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = "
"-Yc``, ``Y = +Xc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip naar boven gericht, 90° linksom gedraaid vanaf :data:`AXIS_P1`\\ . "
"Uitvoerassen: ``X = -Yc``\\ , ``Y = +Xc``\\ , ``Z = +Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:288
msgid ""
"Chip face up in the BNO055 datasheet's default orientation. No remap is "
"applied: ``X = +Xc``, ``Y = +Yc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip naar boven gericht in de standaardoriëntatie van het BNO055-datasheet. "
"Er wordt geen omwisseling toegepast: ``X = +Xc``\\ , ``Y = +Yc``\\ , ``Z = "
"+Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:294
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 180° from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = -Xc``, "
"``Y = -Yc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip naar boven gericht, 180° gedraaid vanaf :data:`AXIS_P1`\\ . "
"Uitvoerassen: ``X = -Xc``\\ , ``Y = -Yc``\\ , ``Z = +Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:300
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 90° CW from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = +Yc``,"
" ``Y = -Xc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip naar boven gericht, 90° rechtsom gedraaid vanaf :data:`AXIS_P1`\\ . "
"Uitvoerassen: ``X = +Yc``\\ , ``Y = -Xc``\\ , ``Z = +Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:306
msgid ""
"Chip flipped onto its back (component side down) relative to "
":data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = +Xc``, ``Y = -Yc``, ``Z = -Zc``. This is"
" the placement used by the :class:`BNO055` constructor when no ``axis`` "
"argument is supplied."
msgstr ""
"Chip op zijn rug gekanteld (componentzijde naar beneden) ten opzichte van "
":data:`AXIS_P1`\\ . Uitvoerassen: ``X = +Xc``\\ , ``Y = -Yc``\\ , ``Z = "
"-Zc``\\ . Dit is de plaatsing die door de :class:`BNO055` constructor wordt "
"gebruikt wanneer geen ``axis`` argument wordt opgegeven."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:314
msgid ""
"Chip face down, rotated 90° CCW from :data:`AXIS_P4`. Output axes: ``X = "
"+Yc``, ``Y = +Xc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip naar beneden gericht, 90° linksom gedraaid vanaf :data:`AXIS_P4`\\ . "
"Uitvoerassen: ``X = +Yc``\\ , ``Y = +Xc``\\ , ``Z = -Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:320
msgid ""
"Chip face down, rotated 180° from :data:`AXIS_P4`. Output axes: ``X = -Yc``,"
" ``Y = -Xc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip naar beneden gericht, 180° gedraaid vanaf :data:`AXIS_P4`\\ . "
"Uitvoerassen: ``X = -Yc``\\ , ``Y = -Xc``\\ , ``Z = -Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:326
msgid ""
"Chip face down, rotated 90° CW from :data:`AXIS_P4`. Output axes: ``X = "
"-Xc``, ``Y = +Yc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip naar beneden gericht, 90° rechtsom gedraaid vanaf :data:`AXIS_P4`\\ . "
"Uitvoerassen: ``X = -Xc``\\ , ``Y = +Yc``\\ , ``Z = -Zc``\\ ."
